---
description: Rails 8 conventions for the sample todo app
alwaysApply: true
---
Todo app only — no foreign models/migrations.
bin/rails generate + reversible migrations; don’t touch schema.rb.
params.expect for mass assignment; respond_to HTML + JSON (jbuilder).
Hotwire/Stimulus (and Turbo Streams when needed), not inline JS or heavy custom scripts.
Minitest + bin/rubocop / CI commands; no new gems or committed secrets.